\item[S2] Benoît R. Kloeckner and Greg Kuperberg, \emph{The Cartan--Hadamard conjecture and The Little Prince} (2017), arXiv:1303.3115v3, Section 1.1, Conjecture 1.2, pp. 2--3, with curvature parameter $\kappa=0$. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1303.3115v3}.
